      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "rewrite Stroika thread interruption mechanism using jthread/stop tokens",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "This looks fairly easy and just a (slight) imrpvoement.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "NOTE - I think Stroiks interrutopn mechanism is just better and easier to use even than jthread.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "JKust SODCUMENT what things are interruption points (mutexes locks are NOT with stdc++). MAYBE add interruptible mutexes (so locks always interruptioble).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "requires C++20.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
         "type" : "doc",
         "version" : 1
